## Conventions

| Topic | Convention in this repo |
| --- | --- |
| Slice naming | Verb + noun (`CreateOrder`), folder `Features/<Area>/<Slice>/` |
| Dispatch | {{DISPATCH}} <!-- direct handler injection / hand-rolled mediator / library name --> |
| Data access | {{DATA_ACCESS}} <!-- DbContext in handlers / ISession / IUnitOfWork / repositories --> |
| Transaction boundary | {{TRANSACTIONS}} <!-- one SaveChanges per handler / filter / unit of work --> |
| Expected outcomes | {{RESULTS}} <!-- union / closed hierarchy / abstract record / exceptions mapped to ProblemDetails --> |
| Validation | {{VALIDATION}} |
| Async | Async I/O only; `CancellationToken ct = default` last on every async method, always passed on; `ConfigureAwait(false)` on every await in `src/` (CA1068, CA2016, CA2007 in `.editorconfig`) |
| Tests | {{TESTS}} <!-- integration-first against <database> in a container; mirrored folders --> |

## Dependency rules

Isolation level: **{{ISOLATION}}** <!-- strict / area-level sharing / relaxed -->

| From | May depend on | Must not depend on |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Slice | its own types, its area's `Shared/`, Domain, Infrastructure | another slice, another area |
| Area `Shared/` | Domain, Infrastructure | any slice, another area |
| Domain | nothing outside Domain | Features, Infrastructure, ASP.NET Core |
| Infrastructure | Domain | Features |

Enforced by: {{ENFORCEMENT}} <!-- architecture tests in tests/X.ArchitectureTests / NsDepCop / none -->

## Where things go

| Thing | Location |
| --- | --- |
| A new use case | `Features/<Area>/<Slice>/` |
| Code two slices in one area share | `Features/<Area>/Shared/` |
| Entities, invariants, domain events | `Domain/` |
| Persistence, clients, pipeline steps | `Infrastructure/` |
| Schema migrations | {{MIGRATIONS_PATH}} |

## Adding a slice

1. Create `Features/<Area>/<Slice>/` with request, outcome, handler, and edge.
2. Register it in `Features/<Area>/<Area>Registration.cs` and map it in `<Area>Endpoints.cs`.
3. Add tests in `tests/{{INTEGRATION_TEST_PROJECT}}/Features/<Area>/<Slice>/`: success, each failure
   outcome, invalid input.
4. Run `dotnet test`; architecture tests must pass.
